  "proof_route": "Expand the printed combination of 3.2.14, 3.2.4, 3.2.2, 2.10.43 and 2.2.3 by positive compact-image selection and an existing opaque maximal disjoint family. Finite measure gives countability; positive remainder contradicts maximality. Unique active partial enumeration preserves disjointness. Compact target selection precedes Borel preimages; source density and Rademacher prove differential agreement after extension before compact source selection."
